  "instructions": [
    "1. In a blender or food processor, blend together coconut milk, lemongrass, ginger, garlic, brown sugar, salt, and black pepper to make marinade.",
    "2. Add chicken pieces to the marinade and mix well. Cover and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "3. Preheat grill to medium-high heat. Thread marinated chicken onto skewers.",
    "4. Grill chicken for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "5. Brush with peanut oil during grilling.",
    "6. Serve with spicy peanut sauce for dipping."
  ],
